        "previousSay": "Finish with a fresh authored request at fourteen hundred. H seven happened at eleven and was published at eleven oh two. H eight happened at thirteen fifty and reached the broker at thirteen fifty-five, but publication completes at fourteen oh three. Both source clocks are valid. Predict the heartbeat and age available to the fourteen-hundred request. Pause."
