        "beat": 1,
        "previousSay": "H seven remains the usable heartbeat, so age is three hours. H eight is still unpublished at that cutoff. Preserve that captured row even after H eight arrives and a higher source revision corrects its phase. At fourteen ten, the same thirteen-fifty timestamp is available and its age is twenty minutes. A later current state does not retroactively answer the earlier request."
      },
